+## Storage and boundary
+
+- Single clock, synchronous active-high `rst` and `cancel`.
+- Exactly two payload banks of `256 x 8` bits: 4096 payload bits (512 bytes).
+- Exactly two descriptor records. No dynamic, unbounded or externally addressed
+  storage is introduced.
+- The file contains only internal candidate RTL ports. There is no public
+  message type, public enum, TRACE header, CRC, source/tick/session/profile
+  field, register map, BOOT source, motion authority or board claim.
+- `fault_code` is a local two-bit diagnostic code, not a public enum:
+  `0` none, `1` invalid descriptor framing, `2` accepted-byte last/length
+  mismatch, `3` reserved.
